l scaffolding in which we live, move, learn, and think.     * Dedication\n    * Epigraph\n    * Foreword\n    * Acknowledgments\n    * Introduction: BRAINBOUND Versus EXTENDED\n  * ### I  \nFROM EMBODIMENT TO COGNITIVE EXTENSION\n\n    * Expand 1 1 The Active Body Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n    * Expand 2 2 The Negotiable Body Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n    * Expand 3 3 Material Symbols Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n    * Expand 4 4 World, Incorporated Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n  * ### II  \nBOUNDARY DISPUTES\n\n    * Expand 5 5 Mind Re‐bound? Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n    * Expand 6 6 The Cure for Cognitive Hiccups (HEMC, HEC, HEMC…) Andy Clark\n\n\n    * Expand 7 7 Rediscovering the Brain Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n  * ### III  \nTHE LIMITS OF EMBODIMENT\n\n    * Expand 8 8 Painting, Planning, and Perceiving Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n    * Expand 9 9 Disentangling Embodiment Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n    * 10 10 Conclusions: Mind as Mashup Andy Clark\n\nView chapter\n\n  * ### End Matter\n\n    * Expand Appendix: The Extended Mind\n    * Expand Notes\n    * References\n    * Index--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Age of AI by Henry A. Kissinger & Eric Schmidt & Daniel Huttenlocher | Hachette Book Group (https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/henry-a-kissinger/the-age-of-ai/9780316274104/?lens=little-brown)\nciteturn353search6 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5.0 years ago; Crawled: last month; \n\n# The Age of AI\n\nAnd Our Human Future\n\nImage: The Age of AI\n\nBy Henry A. Kissinger\n\nBy Eric Schmidt\n\nBy Daniel Huttenlocher\n\nOn Sale\n    Nov 2, 2021\n\nPage Count\n    272 pages\n\nPublisher\n    Little, Brown and Company\n\nISBN-13\n    9780316274104\n\n$12.99\n\n$16.99 CAD\n\n### Format\n\nebook\n\n  1. Audiobook Download (Unabridged)\n  2. Trade Paperback\n\n### Format:\n\n  1. ebook $12.99 $16.99 CAD\n  2. Audiobook Download (Unabridged) $24.99\n  3. Trade Paperback $19.99 $25.99 